<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>SCORE ‚Äî Administrations-Dashboard (Mockup)</title>
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{margin:0; background:#f4f6f8; font-family:"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif; color:#1a1a1a;}
  .wrap{max-width:1280px; margin:0 auto; padding:28px 32px 60px;}
  header{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; margin-bottom:22px; border-bottom:2px solid #1a1a1a; padding-bottom:14px;}
  header h1{margin:0; font-size:24px;}
  header p{margin:4px 0 0; color:#555; font-size:13px;}
  .badge{background:#1a1a1a; color:#fff; font-size:11px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:12px; letter-spacing:.04em;}

  .kpi-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:16px; margin-bottom:24px;}
  .kpi{background:#fff; border:1px solid #e2e5ea; border-radius:8px; padding:16px 18px;}
  .kpi .label{font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.05em; color:#888; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .kpi .value{font-size:26px; font-weight:700;}
  .kpi .delta{font-size:12px; margin-top:4px;}
  .kpi .delta.up{color:#2e7d32;}
  .kpi .delta.down{color:#b85450;}
  .kpi .delta.warn{color:#b35a00;}

  .panel{background:#fff; border:1px solid #e2e5ea; border-radius:8px; padding:20px 22px; margin-bottom:22px;}
  .panel h2{margin:0 0 4px; font-size:16px;}
  .panel .sub{font-size:12.5px; color:#666; margin:0 0 14px; max-width:900px; line-height:1.5;}
  .panel .alert{display:inline-block; margin-top:10px; background:#fff2e0; border:1px solid #e0a95c; color:#8a5300; font-size:12px; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:6px;}
  .chart-row{display:flex; gap:24px; align-items:flex-start; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .legend-box{min-width:180px; font-size:12px;}

  footer{font-size:11px; color:#999; margin-top:10px; text-align:right;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <div>
      <h1>SCORE ‚Äî Administrations-Dashboard</h1>
      <p>Monitoring auf Basis der Historien-Datenbank &amp; Konfigurationstabelle ¬∑ Kapitel 8.2</p>
    </div>
    <span class="badge">MOCKUP</span>
  </header>

  <div class="kpi-row">
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="label">Gesamterkennungsrate (aktuell)</div>
      <div class="value">91 %</div>
      <div class="delta up">‚ñ≤ +2 Pp. gg√º. Vorwoche</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="label">Aktive Verarbeitungsmodule</div>
      <div class="value">4</div>
      <div class="delta">Low-Cost-OCR, LLM klein/mittel/gross</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="label">Modul mit Qualit√§tsr√ºckgang</div>
      <div class="value" style="font-size:18px;">LLM klein</div>
      <div class="delta warn">‚ñº ‚àí13 Pp. in 12 Wochen</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="label">Messgr√∂sse mit sinkender Predictability</div>
      <div class="value" style="font-size:18px;">Zeichenh√∂he</div>
      <div class="delta warn">‚ñº Gewicht 0.15 ‚Üí 0.05</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="label">Datens√§tze in der SCORE-DB</div>
      <div class="value">1'042'318</div>
      <div class="delta up">‚ñ≤ +38'450 diese Woche ¬∑ ‚àí4'230 durch Housekeeping</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi">
      <div class="label">√ò-Alter der SCORE-DB-Datens√§tze</div>
      <div class="value">87 Tage</div>
      <div class="delta">‚ñ¨ stabil gg√º. Vorwoche (86 Tage)</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel">
    <h2>1 ¬∑ Gesamterkennungsrate ohne Nachbearbeitung im Zeitverlauf</h2>
    <p class="sub">Anteil der F√§lle mit Status ¬´erfolgreich¬ª (ohne manuelle Nachbearbeitung) an allen Verarbeitungsf√§llen, aggregiert je Woche. Zeigt die Wirksamkeit des Gesamtsystems unabh√§ngig vom einzelnen Modul.</p>
